# Declining the "may exile it" leaves Creeping Chill in the graveyard and nobody's life changes: "if you do" gates the drain.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thought Scour
Island x6
Creeping Chill
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
